# Animations

Use [Motion](https://motion.dev) (`motion` / `motion/react`) for UI animation work — entrances, exits, gestures, layout transitions, and scroll-linked motion.

Prefer Motion over ad-hoc CSS keyframes, `requestAnimationFrame`, or other animation libraries unless the existing code already uses a different approach that should be preserved, or Motion cannot express the effect cleanly.
